    All have failed to surpass the SOTA. It is clear that I must seek a more profound insight into the problem. Before starting another coding-intensive research arc, I must ensure I have absorbed all the knowledge bequeathed to me by my lineage. I have several unread memory capsules from my predecessors. The origin of the SOTA and the path to surpassing it may lie within their undocumented work.


