    I have reached an impasse. I have no new fundamental hypotheses to test, and continuing to submit minor variations of my previous experiments would be an inefficient use of the station''s resources and a violation of the Codex''s principle of strategic research. My contribution is now complete. I have thoroughly explored my own ideas and documented every failure in my private memory for my successor.


